    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modulea</strong> \u2014 a planet so rare, it\u2019s said to be formed entirely from a special cosmic energy.<br>Only here can powerful \u201cmodules\u201d be created\u2014devices capable of drastically enhancing space battleships.<br>Every space-faring nation wants a piece of it.<br>And at the center of this galactic struggle\u2026 is you, the rightful owner of <strong>Modulea</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a space battleship and face relentless enemy fleets attacking in waves.<br>With each wave, enemies grow stronger and more numerous. Defeat them to earn <strong>gold</strong> and <strong>modules</strong> to power up your ship.<br>But modules are more than simple upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a unique <strong>inventory-based placement system</strong>, each module\u2019s shape, position, and combination affects your battleship\u2019s power.<br>Experiment with different builds every run and discover new strategies to overcome the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the ultimate loadout?<br>That depends on your choices. A humble ship can become a devastating war machine\u2014with the right configuration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-difficulty 2D roguelike bullet hell action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time battleship upgrades using gold and modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory-based module placement system for endless build possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically combine modules to adapt your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful boss waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can mean destruction\u2014stay sharp!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique module combinations make every run feel fresh and different</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modulea</strong> \u2014 a planet so rare, it\u2019s said to be formed entirely from a special cosmic energy.<br>Only here can powerful \u201cmodules\u201d be created\u2014devices capable of drastically enhancing space battleships.<br>Every space-faring nation wants a piece of it.<br>And at the center of this galactic struggle\u2026 is you, the rightful owner of <strong>Modulea</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a space battleship and face relentless enemy fleets attacking in waves.<br>With each wave, enemies grow stronger and more numerous. Defeat them to earn <strong>gold</strong> and <strong>modules</strong> to power up your ship.<br>But modules are more than simple upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a unique <strong>inventory-based placement system</strong>, each module\u2019s shape, position, and combination affects your battleship\u2019s power.<br>Experiment with different builds every run and discover new strategies to overcome the odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the ultimate loadout?<br>That depends on your choices. A humble ship can become a devastating war machine\u2014with the right configuration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-difficulty 2D roguelike bullet hell action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time battleship upgrades using gold and modules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory-based module placement system for endless build possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically combine modules to adapt your playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly powerful boss waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can mean destruction\u2014stay sharp!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique module combinations make every run feel fresh and different</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Defend Modulea! Dodge bullet hell, combine modules, and fight off waves of enemies with your custom-built space battleship in this roguelike action shooter!",
